---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 3, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Startup Sites PH"
  description="The terms that apply when you work with Startup Sites PH or use this website."
>
  <Nav />
  <main>
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="section-inner legal-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow-warm"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>Terms of Service</p>
        <h1 class="warm-title legal-title">The terms behind our work.</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body section">
      <div class="section-inner legal-content warm-card">
        <p>
          These terms apply when you use this website or engage Startup Sites
          PH ("we", "us", "our") for web development, SEO, or social media
          marketing services. By using this site or working with us, you
          agree to the terms below.
        </p>

        <h2>Our services</h2>
        <p>
          We provide website design and development, search engine
          optimization, social media marketing, and ongoing website support.
          The specific scope, deliverables, timeline, and price for any
          project are agreed with you directly, typically through a quote or
          proposal sent after an initial conversation.
        </p>

        <h2>Quotes and payment</h2>
        <p>
          Pricing shown on this website is a general guide and may vary based
          on your project's specific requirements. A final price is confirmed
          before work begins. Unless agreed otherwise in writing, an upfront
          deposit is required to start a project, with the balance due upon
          or before delivery.
        </p>

        <h2>Project timelines</h2>
        <p>
          Delivery estimates shown on this site are typical timeframes and not
          guarantees. Actual timelines depend on project scope, how quickly
          you provide feedback and content, and the complexity of revisions
          requested.
        </p>

        <h2>Revisions</h2>
        <p>
          Each service package includes a defined number of revisions, or
          unlimited revisions where stated. Requests that fall outside the
          agreed project scope may be quoted separately.
        </p>

        <h2>Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          Once a project is paid in full, you own the final website files and
          content created specifically for you. Any third party assets,
          licensed stock media, plugins, or tools used to build the site
          remain subject to their own license terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Ongoing services</h2>
        <p>
          SEO, social media marketing, and support services billed monthly
          continue until either party cancels with reasonable notice, as
          agreed at the start of the engagement. Results from SEO and social
          media marketing depend on many factors outside our direct control,
          including search engines and platform algorithms, and are not
          guaranteed.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          We do our best to deliver reliable, well built work, but we are not
          liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from the use of
          a website or marketing service we provide, including lost revenue,
          lost data, or third party service outages.
        </p>

        <h2>Website use</h2>
        <p>
          This website and its content are provided for general informational
          purposes. You may not copy, resell, or misuse content from this
          site without our permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. Changes will be posted
          on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:admin@startupsitesph.com">admin@startupsitesph.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="legal-disclaimer">
          These terms are provided for general informational purposes and are
          not a substitute for legal advice. If you need terms reviewed for a
          specific legal or regulatory requirement, please consult a qualified
          lawyer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 8rem 0 2rem;
    background: var(--a-bg);
  }

  .legal-hero-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--a-muted);
  }

  .legal-body {
    background: var(--a-bg);
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--a-ink);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display-warm);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--a-muted);
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--a-coral);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-disclaimer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--a-ink) 10%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding-top: 6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
